  "notes": "Per-owner kost room for the 4-player preview test, rebuilt from Ellen's Cove kamar plan (bed left, bathroom right of sekat; sources: kamar_cove_kosong + old VO p_cove.py / index.html). t519: bathtub + shower instead of bak+gayung; this is an explicit exception — public WC (njh_wc_mandi_umum) stays water_tub. t520: complete interactable kitchenette (stove + kitchen_sink + fridge) and lemari storage, all with free reachable use tiles. Kitchen + kulkas + lemari are owner_only (partner may use kasur and kamar mandi, not the owner's food/storage/cook station). ownerId is 'ichsan' (player t_ichsan). Existing catalog TYPEs only. Preview only.",
  "adaptedFrom": "Ellen kamar_cove_kosong (virtual-office-assets/kamar_cove_kosong) + Cove geometry in vo-mp/ind/p_cove.py and virtual-office/index.html. Previous Baymax njh_kos (preview/main-interiors-kost-warteg) was the earlier base; rooms are now rebuilt on the Cove plan.",
